@startuml 06b-seq
' 图 06B：sealed prepare + verifyPackage 时序 — control-plane 消费路径。

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFAF7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"

title 图 06B · sealed admission prepare + verifyPackage
caption <color:#6E6963>通用多轮：Producer 提交证据 → Conformance 验证 → Control-plane prepare。06A · 06G。</color>

legend top right
  |= 线型 |= 语义 |
  | <color:#2E7D32>━━</color> | 主脊：验证/admit |
  | <color:#1565C0>┄┄</color> | Obs 回环：TrustStore |
  | <color:#C62828>- -</color> | Event 重入：cache/revocation |
endlegend

participant "Evidence\nProducer" as Prod
participant "EvidenceStore\n(CAS)" as CAS
participant "ConformanceEngine" as CE
participant "TrustStore" as TS
participant "Human Reviewer\n(HSM)" as HR
participant "ControlPlane\nprepare" as CP

== verifyPackage（机器验证）==
Prod -> CAS : put(artifactDigest, bytes)
Prod -> CE : verifyPackage(manifest, inventory,\nobservedRuleIds, artifactDigests)
CE -> CAS : has/get 复算 digest
CE -> TS : policy/trust checkpoint
CE --> Prod : VerificationDecision\nmachine=verified

== 人类复核（独立 quorum）==
HR -> CE : SignedHumanReviewAttestation\n+ VerifiedDecision
CE -> TS : verifyHumanReviewAttestation\nscope conformance/human-review
CE --> HR : ReviewedDecision sealed

== control-plane prepare ==
Prod -> CP : prepareSchemaAdmission(\nreviewedDecision, signedAttestation,\nfourViewEvidence)
CP -> CE : validateSealedAdmissionPrepare
CE -> TS : 重验 attestation + subject 绑定
CP --> Prod : PreparedSchemaAdmission | blocked

note over CE, TS
  禁止：生产 API 自造 approved
  测试 builder 仅在 @cantilune/conformance/testing
end note

@enduml
